  "description": "Pure in-memory unit-testing harness for Sagant workflows — no ActorSystem, no\n      persistence, no ClusterSharding. Drives a workflow's [WorkflowStep]/[WorkflowCommandHandler]\n      logic directly and lets a Microsoft.Extensions.Time.Testing.FakeTimeProvider control pause- and\n      workflow-level timeouts. Separate from Sagant itself so that package can stay free of any\n      dependency on the testing-time package this one takes on.",
